  {
   "id": "story-of-seasons-grand-bazaar-337026@1.3",
   "gameId": "story-of-seasons-grand-bazaar-337026",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.3",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-12-19T18:06:03.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "You didn’t think we’d forget about you at the holidays, did you? That’s right, we’ve got one more STORY OF SEASONS: Grand Bazaar update for you before the end of the year that doesn’t just bring some quality-of-life adjustments and bug fixes, but another batch of Deluxe Bingo Cards, too!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Four new Deluxe Bingo Cards will be available as part of the 1.3 update, so you’ll have plenty of reason to keep checking in on your farm, your bazaar, and with all the residents of Zephyr Town before year’s end.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You’ll get plenty of great rewards just for doing card-related activities, but the big-time rewards have a hint of holiday vibes sure to make your fashion festive. The Spiffy Checkered Coat, Soft Checkered Coat, Checkered Glider (Belt), and Checkered Glider (Bow), don’t just provide a nice update to your wardrobe; they’ll also give you a sweet seasonal fit.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "The full list of fixes is available below",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "・Added Deluxe Cards, Vol. 3 to Happy Bingo",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Fixed issue during Cheer Time where the button would occasionally stop responding",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Fixed issue preventing the cursor and some visual effects from displaying properly under certain conditions",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Adjusted Horse Treat item to be used as a treat (rather than a meal).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Adjusted harvest yield quantities for select crops",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Adjusted dirt mounds appearing the day after a hurricane or blizzard",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Miscellaneous text adjustments",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Other minor bug fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
